DevOps RAG Agent Demo (ADK-Style) – Team Documentation
 Objective

Build a simple, reliable DevOps RAG agent that:

Reads DevOps troubleshooting docs

Retrieves relevant content (RAG)

Responds to user queries in a chat-style CLI

Is suitable for 5–7 minute classroom / team demo

Avoids unstable SDK/runtime issues

 Architecture (Simplified)
User Question
   ↓
RAG Retrieval (local docs)
   ↓
Agent Reasoning (prompt grounding)
   ↓
Final Answer (grounded, deterministic)


 We intentionally do NOT call ADK runtime methods

This is an ADK-style agent, not a hosted ADK workflow.

